<main class="prayer-shell"><section class="prayer-heading"><div><span class="prayer-eyebrow">PRAYER TIMES</span><h1>A time for<br><em>every prayer.</em></h1><p>Choose your country and city to see daily prayer times and a complete calendar for the year.</p></div><div class="prayer-sun" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M9 69h82M16 79h68M25 89h50M28 69a22 22 0 0 1 44 0M50 14v17M15 34l12 12m46 0 12-12M7 57h16m54 0h16"/><circle cx="50" cy="8" r="1"/></svg></div></section><section class="prayer-form-card" aria-label="Choose your location"><form id="prayer-form"><fieldset id="prayer-fields"><div class="prayer-form-grid"><label for="prayer-country">Country<select id="prayer-country" name="country" required data-i18n-ignore>__COUNTRIES__</select></label><label for="prayer-city">City<input id="prayer-city" name="city" value="Kabul" maxlength="100" autocomplete="address-level2" required dir="auto" placeholder="For example: Kabul"></label><label for="prayer-state">State or province (optional)<input id="prayer-state" name="state" maxlength="100" autocomplete="address-level1" dir="auto"></label><label for="prayer-year">Gregorian year<input id="prayer-year" name="year" type="number" min="1900" max="2100" step="1" required value="2026" inputmode="numeric"></label></div><details><summary>Calculation settings</summary><div class="prayer-advanced"><label for="prayer-method">Calculation method<select id="prayer-method" name="method" data-i18n-ignore><option value="auto">Automatic by location</option></select></label><label for="prayer-school">Asr calculation<select id="prayer-school" name="school" data-i18n-ignore><option value="1">Hanafi</option><option value="0">Standard (Shafi, Maliki, Hanbali)</option></select></label><label for="prayer-highlat">High-latitude adjustment<select id="prayer-highlat" name="highlat" data-i18n-ignore><option value="3">Angle based</option><option value="1">Middle of the night</option><option value="2">One seventh of the night</option></select></label></div></details><div class="prayer-form-actions"><p>Your selected city and country are sent to AlAdhan to retrieve the timetable. No device location permission is requested.</p><button id="prayer-load" class="prayer-primary" type="submit">Load timetable <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></fieldset></form></section><p class="prayer-status" id="prayer-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p><noscript><p class="prayer-status">Enable JavaScript to load the prayer timetable.</p></noscript><section class="prayer-results" id="prayer-results" aria-label="Prayer timetable" hidden><div class="prayer-location-row"><div><span class="prayer-eyebrow">YOUR TIMETABLE</span><h2 class="prayer-place" translate="no"><span id="prayer-location-city"></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span id="prayer-location-country"></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span id="prayer-location-year"></span></h2><p><span>Time zone</span>: <bdi id="prayer-zone" translate="no"></bdi></p><p>All times follow the selected city's local clock, including daylight saving where applicable.</p></div><div><p class="prayer-source"><span>Source</span>: <a href="https://aladhan.com/prayer-times-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AlAdhan</a></p><details class="prayer-meta"><summary>About these times</summary><p><span>Calculation method</span>: <bdi id="prayer-effective-method" translate="no"></bdi></p><p><span>Asr calculation</span>: <span id="prayer-effective-asr" translate="no"></span></p><p><span>High-latitude adjustment</span>: <span id="prayer-effective-highlat" translate="no"></span></p><p><span>Retrieved</span>: <bdi id="prayer-retrieved" translate="no"></bdi></p><a id="prayer-source-url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View source data ↗</a></details></div></div><div class="prayer-daily-heading"><div><h3>Daily prayer times</h3><p id="prayer-day-title" translate="no"></p></div><div class="prayer-tools"><label for="prayer-day">Choose a date<input id="prayer-day" type="date"></label></div></div><div class="prayer-day-grid" id="prayer-day-grid"></div><section class="prayer-calendar" aria-labelledby="prayer-calendar-heading"><div class="prayer-calendar-head"><div><h3 id="prayer-calendar-heading">Annual prayer calendar</h3><p><bdi id="prayer-day-count" translate="no" dir="ltr"></bdi> <span>days shown</span></p></div><div class="prayer-tools"><label for="prayer-month">Display<select id="prayer-month" data-i18n-ignore><option value="all">Full year</option></select></label><button type="button" id="prayer-csv" class="prayer-secondary" disabled>Download full year (CSV)</button></div></div><div class="prayer-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable prayer calendar" tabindex="0"><table class="prayer-table"><caption id="prayer-table-caption" translate="no"></caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Gregorian date</th><th scope="col">Hijri date</th><th scope="col">Fajr</th><th scope="col">Sunrise</th><th scope="col">Dhuhr</th><th scope="col">Asr</th><th scope="col">Maghrib</th><th scope="col">Isha</th></tr></thead><tbody id="prayer-table-body"></tbody></table></div></section><p class="prayer-empty">Times use a 24-hour clock. A dash means the source could not calculate that event. (+1) means the following calendar day.</p></section><aside class="prayer-notes"><h2>Read your timetable with care.</h2><p>These are calculated prayer start times for the selected city, not mosque congregation times. Friday prayer times depend on your mosque.</p><p>Calculation methods can differ by several minutes. Confirm the method and Asr setting with your local mosque or prayer calendar.</p><p>The year selector uses the Gregorian calendar. Hijri dates are calculated and may differ from local moon sighting.</p><p>For places with very long days or nights, choose the high-latitude adjustment used by your local community.</p></aside></main>
